<title>SINGAPORE: Dell cuts Asia OptiPlex price up to 14 pct.</title>
<headline>Dell cuts Asia OptiPlex price up to 14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dell Computer Corp is reducing prices in the Asia Pacific region up to 14 percent on its OptiPlex corporate desktop personal computers, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The price cuts, effective immediately, reflect declining costs and component prices, Dell said. It said the cuts place some OptiPlex PCs up to 30 percent lower in price than comparable systems of certain competitors.</p>
<p>Dell announced a 13 percent price reduction on the same products in the United States last week.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (870-3080)</p>
